OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA damp
OL,6,Fevening, with outbreaks of rain. A
OL,7,Fspell of heavier rain passes through
OL,8,Fin the early hours, followed by
OL,9,Fclearer spells with isolated showers.
OL,10,FStrong and gusty winds throughout.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA brighter day with some
OL,13,Fsunny spells, these mixed with
OL,14,Foccasional blustery showers, some of
OL,15,Fwhich could be heavy. Strong winds
OL,16,Feasing a little later in the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
