OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells Wednesday, with occasional
OL,7,Fshowers. Winds gradually easing. Fog
OL,8,Fpatches possible Thursday and Friday
OL,9,Fmornings, with sunny spells later.
OL,10,FTemperatures near average.
